--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Description:
This library is a thin helper for placing NVTX markers so that DeepStream
activity shows up as named ranges in Nsight Systems and other NVTX aware
profilers. It exposes nvtx_helper_push_pop for nested ranges on the calling
thread and nvtx_helper_start_end for ranges that begin and end on different
threads, correlated by an id.
Refer to the DeepStream SDK documentation for more details.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compiling and installing the library:

  $ sudo make (sudo not required in case of docker containers)
  $ sudo make install (sudo not required in case of docker containers)

The library libnvds_nvtxhelper.so is installed at
/opt/nvidia/deepstream/deepstream/lib/
